leted":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4 rc1\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea6404cb-81c1-4c7c-821c-f48ccf4eb3c9\n\nThere is a Shader unfolded in the inspector. Editing the include causes recompilation of the shader, which makes ShaderMaterial modifed and update the inspector, which re-opens the Shader resource and edits it in the editor.\n\nEasiest fix would be not editing resource again when the inspector is refreshed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP\n2. Open ShaderInclude in shader editor\n3. Click the ColorRect and unfold material -> shader\n4. Edit shader include in shader editor\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[BottomPanelBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18922415/BottomPanelBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103159/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"con